---
description: Push completed work to GitHub without waiting for the user to ask
alwaysApply: true
---

When you finish a meaningful chunk of work in this repo (features, fixes, migrations):

1. Commit with a clear message (user rules for git safety still apply).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch immediately — do not ask the user whether to push.
3. If `origin` is missing, add `https://github.com/meklads/Ruwaq.git` and push with `-u`.
4. Never force-push to `main` unless the user explicitly requests it.
